1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:15,260
I don't want nobody to get killed

2
00:00:15,260 --> 00:00:22,780
I come and get you, I'm always ready to fight

3
00:00:24,780 --> 00:00:29,140
So don't take all of the blame where all is spread

4
00:00:29,140 --> 00:00:32,860
Oh, I don't take all of the blame, you always do

5
00:00:32,860 --> 00:00:36,620
There will always be something you cannot control

6
00:00:36,620 --> 00:00:40,880
We will overcome, your salvation has begun

7
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:46,260
No sun, no light, such a mess, I'm over

8
00:00:46,260 --> 00:00:54,860
Don't kill your walls, you make me realize who I need

9
00:00:54,860 --> 00:00:59,700
I'll be there, hold on, the changes temp house

10
00:00:59,700 --> 00:01:02,540
So where are you now?

11
00:01:03,120 --> 00:01:07,280
I'll reach you, my top, the shadows of the earth

12
00:01:07,280 --> 00:01:10,400
Illusions are born

13
00:01:10,400 --> 00:01:15,920
The golden end is still wrong, but I know it is a pain

14
00:01:15,920 --> 00:01:19,100
That makes us a human after all

15
00:01:19,100 --> 00:01:22,140
Toin' and see me, you follow the good show

16
00:01:22,140 --> 00:01:24,040
About your precious words

17
00:01:24,040 --> 00:01:27,640
This car may respond to your call

18
00:01:27,640 --> 00:01:47,180
It's the four horsemen of John, get out of here!

19
00:01:47,180 --> 00:01:48,440
Shit, we're dead!

20
00:01:48,440 --> 00:01:49,640
Let the place go!

21
00:01:49,640 --> 00:01:53,640
Help me!

22
00:01:53,640 --> 00:02:12,260
My sword

23
00:02:12,260 --> 00:02:25,580
We're saved

24
00:02:25,580 --> 00:02:29,060
Maybe we'll get the same kind of protection they got in Osaka now

25
00:02:29,060 --> 00:02:34,860
They think we've saved them

26
00:02:34,860 --> 00:02:37,660
What idiotic creatures

27
00:02:37,660 --> 00:02:41,120
We're just keeping our livestock fresh

28
00:02:41,120 --> 00:02:42,680
Protecting our property

29
00:02:42,680 --> 00:02:43,960
Right?

30
00:02:43,960 --> 00:02:48,740
Well, it took a hell of a lot of strength to pull off that stunt

31
00:02:48,740 --> 00:02:55,440
Word has it that you became a vampire by drinking the blood of the third progenitor, Queen Cruel Tepish herself

32
00:02:55,440 --> 00:02:58,020
Tell me, are the rumors true?

33
00:02:59,240 --> 00:03:03,640
Regardless of his background, he took the monster down before we could land any blows ourselves

34
00:03:03,640 --> 00:03:06,480
Greedy bastard probably wants credit for the kill

35
00:03:06,480 --> 00:03:09,200
You can have the body if you want it

36
00:03:09,200 --> 00:03:11,060
Credit means nothing to me

37
00:03:11,060 --> 00:03:18,740
From now on, this district will be governed by the vampires

38
00:03:18,740 --> 00:03:20,560
We can guarantee your safety

39
00:03:20,560 --> 00:03:26,440
In exchange for our protection, all we ask is that you donate blood so we may continue to keep you safe from harm

40
00:03:26,440 --> 00:03:30,900
Um, hello

41
00:03:30,900 --> 00:03:34,120
I would have died if you hadn't stopped that monster

42
00:03:34,120 --> 00:03:36,260
I'm so grateful to be alive

43
00:03:36,260 --> 00:03:40,520
Let me show my gratitude by offering my blood

44
00:03:40,520 --> 00:03:45,080
Please drink until you're satisfied

45
00:03:45,080 --> 00:03:48,900
A memory surfaces

46
00:03:48,900 --> 00:03:52,080
They only look after us because we're their food

47
00:03:52,080 --> 00:03:53,480
Listen to me, Mika

48
00:03:53,480 --> 00:03:55,660
We've got to start a full-blown revolution

49
00:03:55,660 --> 00:03:58,120
Otherwise, we're going to be livestock forever

50
00:03:58,120 --> 00:04:01,500
Jeez, you always want to do stuff that'll get us in trouble

51
00:04:01,500 --> 00:04:03,840
We're only in trouble if it doesn't work

52
00:04:03,840 --> 00:04:07,380
There's no way we could beat the vampires in a frontal assault

53
00:04:07,380 --> 00:04:09,620
Outsmarting them is the only way to go

54
00:04:09,620 --> 00:04:12,900
I actually have an escape plan already

55
00:04:12,900 --> 00:04:15,660
We can run away from the vampires together

56
00:04:15,660 --> 00:04:19,020
You can leave everything up to me

57
00:04:19,020 --> 00:04:23,880
I had so much hope in the time before my humanity ended

58
00:04:23,880 --> 00:04:28,580
But then, it was because of this foolish hope that everything fell apart

59
00:04:28,580 --> 00:04:30,020
Just go, you idiot!

60
00:04:30,560 --> 00:04:31,120
No!

61
00:04:31,120 --> 00:04:38,000
I'm... happy

62
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:40,940
I can leave this world at peace

63
00:04:40,940 --> 00:04:43,260
Knowing you've escaped

64
00:04:43,260 --> 00:04:48,400
What the hell happened here?

65
00:04:50,540 --> 00:04:52,340
Lord Ferret appears to be injured

66
00:04:52,340 --> 00:04:56,000
How dare one of these filthy humans lay a hand on a noble?

67
00:04:56,700 --> 00:04:58,100
Hold it right there!

68
00:04:58,100 --> 00:05:01,700
I've taken a particular interest in the blonde one

69
00:05:01,700 --> 00:05:04,220
Anything you wish, my queen

70
00:05:04,220 --> 00:05:06,180
He's losing a lot of blood

71
00:05:06,180 --> 00:05:07,180
So I see

72
00:05:07,180 --> 00:05:13,100
At this rate, he won't last much longer

73
00:05:13,100 --> 00:05:16,800
I wonder how these children managed to catch you by surprise

74
00:05:16,800 --> 00:05:18,380
Lord Ferret Bathory

75
00:05:18,380 --> 00:05:23,460
Dear me

76
00:05:23,460 --> 00:05:28,040
What a treat it is to be visited by our beloved queen, cruel Tepish herself

77
00:05:28,040 --> 00:05:30,080
It's been far too long

78
00:05:30,080 --> 00:05:32,780
You look ravishing as always

79
00:05:32,780 --> 00:05:34,960
Why, thank you

80
00:05:34,960 --> 00:05:38,840
And your grin is as smug and nauseating as I recall

81
00:05:38,840 --> 00:05:40,320
How cruel

82
00:05:40,320 --> 00:05:42,740
Here I am with a gunshot wound to my head

83
00:05:42,740 --> 00:05:46,500
Yet I still manage a smile on my face because of my love for you

84
00:05:46,500 --> 00:05:47,460
Really?

85
00:05:47,880 --> 00:05:51,040
I think the only thing that you truly love about me is my power

86
00:05:51,040 --> 00:05:54,160
You know my heart too well

87
00:05:54,160 --> 00:05:56,700
You were attacked and injured by human children?

88
00:05:56,700 --> 00:05:59,200
You were seventh progenitor for crying out loud

89
00:05:59,200 --> 00:06:00,540
Wait, is this a joke?

90
00:06:00,540 --> 00:06:02,080
I'm afraid it's not

91
00:06:02,080 --> 00:06:04,860
I see, I didn't think you were that funny, Ferret

92
00:06:04,860 --> 00:06:07,120
But now one of my seraphs has escaped

93
00:06:07,120 --> 00:06:09,820
And the other one is dying, barely clinging to life

94
00:06:09,820 --> 00:06:14,400
If you have any explanation for your actions, now would be the time for you to start

95
00:06:14,400 --> 00:06:18,140
Ah, but you have plenty of explaining to do yourself, don't you, my queen?

96
00:06:19,760 --> 00:06:23,240
You've been fiddling with the curse of the seraphs and that's against the law

97
00:06:23,240 --> 00:06:26,700
If the progenitor council knew, they'd be furious

98
00:06:26,700 --> 00:06:28,660
Hmm, what did you say?

99
00:06:29,220 --> 00:06:30,240
You heard me

100
00:06:30,240 --> 00:06:32,100
If I told the progenitor council

101
00:06:32,100 --> 00:06:40,820
Oh, what's the matter, my queen?

102
00:06:40,900 --> 00:06:41,880
Did I hit a nerve?

103
00:06:41,880 --> 00:06:51,400
I'm sorry, I didn't catch what you were saying

104
00:06:51,400 --> 00:06:52,740
Let's hear it one more time

105
00:06:52,740 --> 00:06:54,660
You're so violent, cruel

106
00:06:54,660 --> 00:06:56,480
Losing a limb hurts like hell

107
00:06:56,480 --> 00:06:58,740
Even if I can reattach it and heal myself

108
00:06:58,740 --> 00:07:01,300
You're lucky all I ripped off was your arm

109
00:07:01,300 --> 00:07:03,580
This lover's spat has taken a turn

110
00:07:03,580 --> 00:07:06,000
Alright, I am at your mercy

111
00:07:06,000 --> 00:07:08,760
I promise not to meddle in your affairs any longer

112
00:07:08,760 --> 00:07:12,160
I'm not an idiot

113
00:07:12,160 --> 00:07:14,460
I know I couldn't survive crossing you

114
00:07:14,460 --> 00:07:18,280
My lips are sealed when it comes to your precious seraphs

115
00:07:18,280 --> 00:07:22,240
Good, they better be

116
00:07:22,240 --> 00:07:25,260
Because if you pry into this matter again, you'll regret it

117
00:07:25,260 --> 00:07:30,020
Don't worry, I value my life far too much to do that

118
00:07:30,020 --> 00:07:35,900
But you haven't seen the last of me, cruel

119
00:07:35,900 --> 00:07:38,800
After all, I do love you

120
00:07:38,800 --> 00:07:46,040
Hey, human

121
00:07:46,040 --> 00:07:47,680
Do you want to bleed out?

122
00:07:48,240 --> 00:07:50,740
Because I can ensure that you survive all of this

123
00:07:50,740 --> 00:07:52,600
I offer eternal life

124
00:07:52,600 --> 00:07:55,500
I don't want it

125
00:07:55,500 --> 00:07:58,440
I see, so you want to die like your friends

126
00:07:58,440 --> 00:08:05,060
Unfortunately, you don't have much of a choice

127
00:08:05,060 --> 00:08:09,260
Once you drink my blood, you'll become something far superior to a human

128
00:08:09,260 --> 00:08:18,940
That was the moment

129
00:08:18,940 --> 00:08:21,040
I lost my humanity

130
00:08:21,040 --> 00:08:34,800
Hey, watch where you're going, you damn punk

131
00:08:34,800 --> 00:08:35,960
Huh?

132
00:08:36,520 --> 00:08:38,320
You trying to start a fight or something?

133
00:08:38,560 --> 00:08:40,040
Wait, what are you talking about?

134
00:08:40,040 --> 00:08:46,240
What the hell do you think you're doing?

135
00:08:47,740 --> 00:08:49,120
Alright, you bastard

136
00:08:49,120 --> 00:08:50,460
You asked for it

137
00:08:50,460 --> 00:08:53,340
Whoa, you?

138
00:08:53,620 --> 00:08:54,940
What happened to your face?

139
00:08:55,700 --> 00:08:57,940
I walked into a telephone pole

140
00:08:57,940 --> 00:08:59,460
A telephone pole?

141
00:09:00,180 --> 00:09:01,060
That's right

142
00:09:01,060 --> 00:09:05,080
A telephone pole with a nasty look and a really bad attitude

143
00:09:05,080 --> 00:09:06,860
Sounds painful

144
00:09:06,860 --> 00:09:10,600
The two of you are late

145
00:09:10,600 --> 00:09:13,880
Whatever, we're here now

146
00:09:13,880 --> 00:09:16,940
Looks like someone pummeled your face

147
00:09:16,940 --> 00:09:18,800
Is another suspension in order?

148
00:09:19,620 --> 00:09:21,220
It was an accident, not a fight

149
00:09:21,220 --> 00:09:23,920
Well, alright, if you say so

150
00:09:23,920 --> 00:09:26,580
Besides, we've got much bigger things on our plate today

151
00:09:26,580 --> 00:09:28,440
Yeah, I'm so psyched

152
00:09:28,440 --> 00:09:30,920
After all this waiting, we finally get to start training

153
00:09:30,920 --> 00:09:32,840
To become members of the Moon Demon Company

154
00:09:32,840 --> 00:09:34,700
You already know I don't need any training

155
00:09:34,700 --> 00:09:36,980
Save us all some time and just put me in action

156
00:09:36,980 --> 00:09:38,560
I'd be fine with that

157
00:09:38,560 --> 00:09:41,140
But if you're not willing to put in the time to go through training

158
00:09:41,140 --> 00:09:43,360
You're going to fight without gear or a uniform

159
00:09:43,360 --> 00:09:46,060
I'm not killing vampires buck naked

160
00:09:46,060 --> 00:09:55,160
Excuse me, everyone

161
00:09:55,160 --> 00:10:01,300
I brought these two slowpokes with me, Lieutenant Colonel

162
00:10:01,300 --> 00:10:04,080
Uh, sir?

163
00:10:06,440 --> 00:10:06,920
Fine

164
00:10:06,920 --> 00:10:09,980
Time to get started

165
00:10:09,980 --> 00:10:12,740
The reason I'm making a rare appearance in class today

166
00:10:12,740 --> 00:10:16,100
Is because we've got a couple of transfer students I want to introduce you to

167
00:10:16,100 --> 00:10:18,280
You know, just for your information

168
00:10:18,280 --> 00:10:22,700
The supervising teacher should probably be coming to class every day

169
00:10:22,700 --> 00:10:24,920
Why don't you mind your own business?

170
00:10:25,480 --> 00:10:26,440
So, anyway

171
00:10:26,440 --> 00:10:28,520
As I was saying, these are the transfers

172
00:10:28,520 --> 00:10:31,600
Yuichiro Hyakuya and Yuichi Saotome

173
00:10:31,600 --> 00:10:35,420
Though it might be easier to remember them as the idiot and the wuss

174
00:10:35,420 --> 00:10:36,680
You're calling me an idiot?

175
00:10:37,500 --> 00:10:38,560
Well, it's the truth

176
00:10:38,560 --> 00:10:40,700
Now go ahead and introduce yourselves

177
00:10:40,700 --> 00:10:41,920
Why bother?

178
00:10:42,700 --> 00:10:45,340
I don't care about any of the other people in this class

179
00:10:45,340 --> 00:10:48,500
I'm not here to be liked or make friends

180
00:10:48,500 --> 00:10:51,820
You weaklings can piss off and become vampire food for all I care

181
00:10:51,820 --> 00:10:53,660
Whoa, what's gotten into you?

182
00:10:54,400 --> 00:10:55,740
Let's make one thing clear

183
00:10:55,740 --> 00:10:58,880
I don't know which one of you losers was the best in class till now

184
00:10:58,880 --> 00:11:00,180
But you can kiss that goodbye

185
00:11:00,180 --> 00:11:02,140
The strongest cursed gear is mine

186
00:11:02,140 --> 00:11:05,260
I shouldn't even be wasting my time here

187
00:11:05,260 --> 00:11:06,860
I deserve to be in the company

188
00:11:06,860 --> 00:11:09,520
No, you deserve this

189
00:11:09,520 --> 00:11:14,420
I don't know what you learned in that general ed class

190
00:11:14,420 --> 00:11:16,420
But here we work together as a team

191
00:11:16,420 --> 00:11:19,400
Thought you might have learned your place by now

192
00:11:19,400 --> 00:11:21,560
Go on, take a seat in the back row

193
00:11:21,560 --> 00:11:25,660
Stupid Gorin

194
00:11:25,660 --> 00:11:26,920
Thinks he knows everything

195
00:11:26,920 --> 00:11:32,140
Hey, move your feet

196
00:11:32,140 --> 00:11:35,020
This is where the lieutenant colonel said I'm supposed to sit

197
00:11:35,020 --> 00:11:36,660
You listening?

198
00:11:36,980 --> 00:11:38,040
Time to get moving

199
00:11:38,040 --> 00:11:40,380
Can't you see that I'm trying to sleep?

200
00:11:41,040 --> 00:11:42,040
Back off

201
00:11:42,040 --> 00:11:47,940
So we meet again, telephone pole

202
00:11:47,940 --> 00:11:49,340
What are you doing here?

203
00:11:50,100 --> 00:11:52,420
I could ask you the same question, you twerp

204
00:11:52,420 --> 00:11:54,060
And what do you mean, telephone pole?

205
00:11:54,780 --> 00:11:56,400
What's the story with those two?

206
00:11:56,960 --> 00:11:59,780
Mizuki was starting to seem friendlier and less volatile

207
00:11:59,780 --> 00:12:02,460
But seeing Yuiichiro just completely set him off

208
00:12:02,460 --> 00:12:04,000
I thought you were working on them

209
00:12:04,000 --> 00:12:06,140
Very diligently

210
00:12:06,140 --> 00:12:07,560
And the result?

211
00:12:07,560 --> 00:12:09,800
This is a marked improvement

212
00:12:09,800 --> 00:12:12,620
You were supposed to keep close watch over them

213
00:12:12,620 --> 00:12:14,120
But I did watch them, sir

214
00:12:14,120 --> 00:12:18,760
This morning, Kimizuki attacked Hyakuya to test his ability

215
00:12:18,760 --> 00:12:21,320
And maintain his alpha dominance over the students

216
00:12:21,320 --> 00:12:22,360
And?

217
00:12:22,600 --> 00:12:24,220
Did you step in and break up the fight?

218
00:12:25,320 --> 00:12:27,620
Actually, I stayed in hiding and enjoyed the show

219
00:12:27,620 --> 00:12:30,620
I'm beginning to think you're not very good at your job

220
00:12:30,620 --> 00:12:33,860
Enough of this!

221
00:12:33,860 --> 00:12:37,940
Uh, are they okay?

222
00:12:38,940 --> 00:12:39,900
They'll be fine

223
00:12:39,900 --> 00:12:41,780
Let's get to work, everyone

224
00:12:41,780 --> 00:12:43,700
Maybe I can teach the rest of you something

225
00:12:43,700 --> 00:13:01,300
Lieutenant Colonel Ichinose

226
00:13:01,300 --> 00:13:03,860
I don't mean to intrude

227
00:13:03,860 --> 00:13:05,420
But do you have time to talk?

228
00:13:06,180 --> 00:13:06,600
No

229
00:13:06,600 --> 00:13:08,600
And don't come in here without permission

230
00:13:08,600 --> 00:13:13,040
I just have a question about the Cursed Gear aptitude test a week from now

231
00:13:13,040 --> 00:13:18,520
On that day, I'll be given the chance to try out for the top-ranked Black Demon series, right?

232
00:13:18,780 --> 00:13:20,420
You're starting to wear out your welcome

233
00:13:20,420 --> 00:13:23,160
My grades are better than everyone else's

234
00:13:23,160 --> 00:13:24,780
I'm the strongest student in class

235
00:13:24,780 --> 00:13:28,940
Why is it so important for you to have that kind of power?

236
00:13:29,820 --> 00:13:32,120
The army does background checks on all of us

237
00:13:32,120 --> 00:13:34,780
I'm sure you've read the files on each potential recruit

238
00:13:34,780 --> 00:13:36,960
Yeah, I know all about your history

239
00:13:36,960 --> 00:13:40,580
You've got a sister who's been infected with the apocalypse virus

240
00:13:40,580 --> 00:13:42,220
And now you're looking for a cure

241
00:13:42,220 --> 00:13:47,680
I understand your intentions

242
00:13:47,680 --> 00:13:51,540
There are certain perks that come with being a member of the Moon Demon Company

243
00:13:51,540 --> 00:13:55,460
Things like unlimited medical treatments that are unavailable to the rest of the public

244
00:13:55,460 --> 00:14:00,540
Unfortunately, you've still got a lot of training to go through

245
00:14:00,540 --> 00:14:04,060
In your current state, you couldn't even touch the Cursed Gear

246
00:14:04,060 --> 00:14:08,220
It would feed off of your desire for a cure and eventually consume you

247
00:14:08,220 --> 00:14:12,820
But I bet that you're going to let Hyakuya try out any weapon he wants, aren't you?

248
00:14:13,380 --> 00:14:15,020
That all remains to be seen

249
00:14:15,020 --> 00:14:17,160
Although he has shown some talent

250
00:14:17,160 --> 00:14:19,500
He's even broken free from a demon once already

251
00:14:19,500 --> 00:14:25,080
And despite his attitude, he's someone who looks out for his friends

252
00:14:25,080 --> 00:14:26,260
That's bullshit!

253
00:14:26,820 --> 00:14:28,620
I'm way stronger than he'll ever be!

254
00:14:28,620 --> 00:14:30,840
Strength isn't everything

255
00:14:30,840 --> 00:14:32,200
You need to learn that

256
00:14:32,200 --> 00:14:34,080
Make some friends

257
00:14:34,080 --> 00:14:35,340
Form a support system

258
00:14:35,340 --> 00:14:37,120
Stop taking everything on yourself

259
00:14:37,120 --> 00:14:38,120
Otherwise...

260
00:14:38,120 --> 00:14:42,220
When you find yourself face to face with a demon

261
00:14:42,220 --> 00:14:44,560
You'll have no chance of controlling it

262
00:14:58,620 --> 00:15:05,140
Demons feast upon desperation and rage

263
00:15:05,140 --> 00:15:09,780
If you attempted a contract now, you'd be swallowed whole and never find your way out

264
00:15:09,780 --> 00:15:10,780
Hey everyone!

265
00:15:10,780 --> 00:15:11,780
Listen up students!

266
00:15:11,780 --> 00:15:25,000
In preparation for next week's Cursed Gear Aptitude Test, I will be assessing all of your abilities

267
00:15:25,000 --> 00:15:30,480
If you can't show me you're ready here, then you'll have to keep training and take the test at a later date

268
